     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p>For a datatable,  if there is only ONE option for &quot;selecting a row&quot; (i.e. selected or unselected),  I can use the following code to get the selected rows index:<div>             idx &lt;-  input$dt_rows_selected</div><div>In this case, I don&#39;t need a checkbox column. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Now I need to show a datatable with two options,  for example, </div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pmuxVcrcwHs/VgicB6AObAI/AAAAAAAAANs/tWPxxnjD9j0/s1600/Capture.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pmuxVcrcwHs/VgicB6AObAI/AAAAAAAAANs/tWPxxnjD9j0/s1600/Capture.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792396636869000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17Yr40jIK2iX5z_rFh14iY\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pmuxVcrcwHs/VgicB6AObAI/AAAAAAAAANs/tWPxxnjD9j0/s1600/Capture.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div>The code: </div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> iris<br><br><br>runApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;dtTb&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                        <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        <br>    output$dtTb </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>      df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cbind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;input id=&#39;type1_&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span